markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>The Loop Debugging Checklist</h1>

<p>Before fixing AI-generated code, QA teams test first. The checklist below isn't a fix-it list, it's a diagnostic tool: the goal is to identify exactly which check catches the problem before touching a single line of code.</p>

<p>Below is a real prompt and the loop AI generated for it. Work through all five checks and find which one actually catches the bug.</p>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
<p>This exact debugging process is taught to students in Lesson 11, where they follow along using the checklist in their Unit Guide.</p>
<a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NfYrDasBjCfsD80xV3CsmipdN1udz9TVuE_7IBFSsKo/edit?usp=sharing" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Student Unit Guide</a>
</div>

